# GCP service account key -- used only to authenticate the local `gcloud`
# CLI for deploys, never read by the running app (nothing in the codebase
# references it or GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS). Without this, it was
# being copied straight into the built container image on every deploy.
*-key.json
gcp-key.json
